Author:     Umesh Shrestha <stha.ums@gmail.com>
AuthorDate: 2025-10-27
Commit:     Umesh Shrestha <stha.ums@gmail.com>
CommitDate: 2025-10-27

    fix: update TikTok photo post API request structure
    
    - Add title truncation to 90 characters per TikTok API limit
    - Restructure request body to match TikTok Photo Post API reference
    - Remove description field (not used for photo posts)
    - Set brand_organic_toggle default to true (matching Postiz)
    - Reorder fields to match API documentation structure
    - Add debug logging for photo URLs and request body

content-publisher/helpers/tiktokApiHelper.js

commit b8dc7f6844d2c9ea5e8fb80e50261d05e3705b23
Author:     Umesh Shrestha <umesh@inicreatechnologies.com>
AuthorDate: 2025-10-26
Commit:     GitHub <noreply@github.com>
CommitDate: 2025-10-26

    feat: implement TikTok post settings and improve publishing reliability (#70)
    
    - Add TikTok settings support (privacy level, comment/duet/stitch controls, brand content)
    - Transform DB field names (*_disabled) to TikTok API format (disable_*) during publishing
    - Add 30-second timeouts to all TikTok API calls for better error handling
    - Implement 24-hour caching for TikTok creator info to reduce API calls
    - Enable retry functionality for failed posts (allow re-publishing)
    - Skip already-published platforms during retry attempts
    - Improve error handling with non-critical EventBridge cleanup
    - Add flexible metrics storage using Schema.Types.Mixed
    - Add comprehensive debug logging for TikTok settings
    
    Co-authored-by: Umesh Shrestha <stha.ums@gmail.com>

